---

### 1. What you may do
- **Use:** Download the official release from our official pages (Modrinth, Hangar, CurseForge, or this repository) and run it free of charge on Minecraft servers you own or administer, including public and commercial servers.
- **Configure:** Edit the plugin's configuration, template, and message files on your own server to customize its behavior and language.
- **Read:** View the source code for review, security auditing, and learning.
- **Contribute:** Fork this repository on GitHub solely to prepare changes and submit them back to Clodo as a pull request, and open issues or share feedback.
- **Share links:** Link to our official pages and repository, including the standard automatic previews generated by platforms.

---

### 2. What you may not do
Without prior written permission from Clodo, you may not:
- Publish, upload, distribute, mirror, or sell StartFlow, any modified version of it, or any part of its source code or build outputs on any site, marketplace, or platform other than as allowed in Section 1.
- Publish a fork, rebranded copy, or derivative work of StartFlow.
- Remove or alter the copyright notices, the Clodo name, or the Clodo links and credits included in the plugin, its files, or its pages.
- Sublicense, rent, or commercially exploit StartFlow itself, other than running it on your own servers as allowed in Section 1.

